                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_0_CR1_0_WB_0" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<p><strong><span>Mission Statement</span></strong></p>
<p><span>"The mission of the Guadalupe County Elections Office is to ensure a fair, transparent, and efficient electoral process that upholds the democratic rights of all eligible voters. We are committed to providing accurate and timely information, ensuring accessibility for all voters, and maintaining the integrity of the voting process. Our goal is to foster public trust in elections by administering them with professionalism, impartiality, and accountability."</span></p>
</div></div>
                    
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_0_ezCol2_0" class="ezlayout2Col2" style="width:27%;">
        <div class="widgettable">
                
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_0_CR2_0_WB_0" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;"><div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_0_CR2_0_ctl00_0_divImage_0">
<a id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_0_CR2_0_ctl00_0_aImage_0"></a>
</div>
</div>
                    
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_0_CR2_0_WB_1" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">

<div class="ezlayout2">
    <div class="widgettable">
        
    </div>
</div>
</div>
                    
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_1" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:30px;margin-bottom:30px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<hr />
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_2" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h2 style="text-align: left;"><span class="Heading2">Current Running Elections</span></h2>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left;" class="SmallText">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left;"><strong><span class="Heading4">Click on the date below to see all information regarding that election.</span></strong></span></p>
<!--<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="/page/elections.election4" class="btn"><span class="btn2">April 4, 2026 City of Schertz Special Election</span></a></p>-->
<!--<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="/page/elections.election5" class="btn"><span class="btn2">May 16, 2026 City of Schertz Runoff Election</span></a></p>-->
<!--<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="/page/elections.election2" class="btn"><span class="btn2">May 26, 2026 Primary Runoff Elections</span></a></p>-->
<!--<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="/page/elections.election3" class="btn"><span class="btn2">June 13, 2026 City of New Braunfels Runoff Elections</span></a></p>-->
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="/page/elections.election1" class="btn"><span class="btn2">November 3, 2026 General &amp; Special Elections</span></a></p>
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_3" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<hr />
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_4" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h3 style="text-align: left;"><span class="Heading2">Notice of Boundary Change Precincts 208 &amp; 415</span></h3>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><a href="/upload/page/0063/docs/Signed Order to Approve the Creation and Change of Voting Precincts 2025.pdf" target="_blank">Signed Order to Approve Change of Voting Precincts</a></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><a href="/upload/page/0063/docs/BOUNDARY CHANGE.pdf" target="_blank">Notice of Boundary Change</a></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><a href="/upload/page/0063/docs/Precinct 208 Splits.pdf" target="_blank">Precinct 208 Map</a></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><a href="/upload/page/0063/docs/Precinct 415 Splits.pdf" target="_blank">Precinct 415 Map</a></p>
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_5" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<hr />
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_6" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h3 style="text-align: left;"><span class="Heading2">Notices</span></h3>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><a href="/upload/page/0063/07.28.2026 Election Commission Mtg - Posted Notice.pdf" target="_blank">Guadalupe County Election Commission Notice of Public Meeting</a><a href="/upload/page/0063/07.28.2026 Election Commission Mtg - Posted Notice.pdf" target="_blank">&nbsp;July 28, 2026 (PDF)</a></p>
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_7" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<hr />
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_8" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:50px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h3><span class="Heading2">Important Elections Information</span></h3>
</div></div>
        
            <div id="CP4_CR4_WB_9" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">

<div class="ezlayout2">
    <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_ezCol1_9" class="ezlayout2Col1" style="width:49%;">
        <div class="widgettable">
                
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR1_9_WB_0" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h3><strong>VOLUNTEER DEPUTY REGISTRAR REQUIREMENTS</strong></h3>
If you are interested in becoming a Volunteer Deputy Voter Registrar, you must attend training. Classes will be held on the 2nd Wednesday of each month beginning at 3 p.m. at the Seguin Elections Office. Please call 830-303-6363 to register to attend.
</div></div>
                    
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR1_9_WB_1" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<hr />
</div></div>
                    
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR1_9_WB_2" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h3><strong>VOTER ID REQUIREMENTS</strong></h3>
Texas voters must show acceptable photo identification at the polling location before being accepted for voting, please refer to the link below for voter ID requirements.<br />
<a href="/upload/page/0063/docs/Notice_of_Required_Identification.pdf" target="_blank">New Voter ID Requirements (pdf)</a>
</div></div>
                    
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_ezCol2_9" class="ezlayout2Col2" style="width:51%;">
        <div class="widgettable">
                
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR2_9_WB_0" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h3><strong>POLITICAL SIGN ORDINANCE</strong></h3>
Political sign ordinances are governed by <a href="https://www.ethics.state.tx.us/resources/advertising/" target="_blank">Texas Ethics Commission</a>, <a href="https://www.txdot.gov/inside-txdot/division/right-of-way/campaign-signs.html" target="_blank">Texas Department of Transportation</a>, and <a href="/upload/page/0063/docs/Political_Signs.pdf" target="_blank">Guadalupe County (pdf)</a> and local jurisdictions.
</div></div>
                    
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR2_9_WB_1" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<hr />
</div></div>
                    
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR2_9_WB_2" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<h3><strong>NAME / ADDRESS CHANGE</strong></h3>
To check if your information matches, click here:<br />
<a href="http://www.votetexas.gov/">VoteTexas.gov</a>
</div></div>
                    
                        <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR2_9_WB_3" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">

<div class="ezlayout2">
    <div class="widgettable">
        
                  <div id="CP4_CR4_ctl00_9_CR2_9_ctl00_3_CR1_3_WB_0" class="widgetitem" style="margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:5px;">
<div class="eztext_area">
<span class="Heading2">&nbsp;</span>
</div></div>
            
    </div>
</div>
