<div class="eztext_area">
<p><strong>REGISTERED TO VOTE? CHECK HERE</strong></p>
<p>Link:&nbsp;<a href="https://goelect.txelections.civixapps.com/ivis-mvp-ui/#/login" target="_blank">Texas Secretary of State&nbsp;</a></p>
</div></div>
            
